    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n30352" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Namnētes</span></b> , um,
		m., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a
				people in Celtic Gaul, near the site of Nantes</i>, <i><span class="en">Caes. B. G.
				3, 9, 10</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 4, 18, 32, §
